B.aI7=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Chainsaw","Chainsaw",B.aj,"[Reaction] During Yours or an Enemies Turn: Start your chainsaw and begin concentrating: While Concentrating, on success with a chainsaw attack, give the target {Half Source} d6 bleed. You cannot use your chainsaw other than as an improvised weapon if its not started. Other creatures can start a chainsaw but must succeed a create skill.","1","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Str")
