B.TC=new A.bY("melee_ancient","Ancient","On Player Failure, Allies within {Level} have Resistance to attacks as if they had this unit's defenses. On Player Success, allies within 1 have Resistance to attacks as if they had this unit's defenses.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Tz=new A.bY("melee_berserker","Berserker","On Player Failure, Knock the target prone, deal {Level/3} d6 extra damage, and Until the start of their next turn, the chump has resistance to all damage.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends its turn range 1, make a Berserker attack.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.T9=new A.bY("melee_challenger","Challenger","On Player Failure, the target cannot disengage and must include this unit as a target of all attacks or suffer disadvantage on their next turn. On Failure, Target a player that they can see and have them make a Wis defense, On Player Failure, they are challenged as if attacked.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Tb=new A.bY("melee_defender","Defender","On Player Failure, players have -1 to attacks against this chump and their adjacent allies until the start of their next turn. On Player Success, players have -1 to attack against this chump's allies who are range 1 of this defender.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Tw=new A.bY("melee_feasting","Feasting","On Player Failure, Heal half the damage they deal and knock the target prone. If the target dies or the first time they feast on a dead body, heal the full amount.\n[Reaction] When an enemy dies or is knocked prone within half speed, dash to a space adjacent to the target and make a Feasting Attack against the target or an enemy range 1.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Tf=new A.bY("melee_frozen","Frozen","On Player Failure, The target and enemies adjacent to either the target or you, gains {Level/3} Cold.\n[Reaction] When a Player Succeeds an attack against the chump and they resist the damage, give {Level/4} cold to enemies adjacent to the chump.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Tp=new A.bY("melee_guard","Guard","On Player Failure, During the target's next turn their speed is 0.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes adjacent, make the guard attack, the effect applies to their current turn.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Tk=new A.bY("melee_paladin","Paladin","On Player Failure, heal an ally equal to half the damage dealt.\n[Reaction] During an adjacent ally's turn, you may reduce this chump's HP and give it to that ally.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.Ti=new A.bY("melee_stampeding","Stampeding","Instead, Move up to half their speed, moving through enemies. Each target makes a Dex Defense, On Player Failure, they take {Damage} and are knocked prone.\n[Reaction] After a Player Succeeds an Attack against them, you may have them stamped.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.T7=new A.bY("melee_valorous","Valorous","On Player Failure, this chump resists all damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range {Level} is successfully attacked and that attack didn't include this chump as a target, this chump takes the damage instead of the target. Effects still target the original character.",B.cb,B.dd)
B.du=new A.kj(1,"controller")
B.TD=new A.bY("melee_bully","Bully","On Player Failure, knock them prone.\n[Reaction] When an ally attacks a player in range, make the bully attack.",B.cb,B.du)
B.Tg=new A.bY("melee_grabber","Grabber","On Player Failure, the target is grappled.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a grabbing attack.",B.cb,B.du)
