B.TK=new A.bY("melee_parasite","Parasite","On Player Failure, instead give the target {Half Level} d6 Bleed then the chump attaches to the Target. While attached, players cannot target the chump and the chump shares a space with the target. The Chump heals half of all bleed damage the target takes. At the Start of the Target's turn, they must make a Vit Defense. On Player Failure, they take {Basic Damage} damage and gain 1 d6 Bleed. On Player Success, the effect ends and the chump is in an adjacent location.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a parasite attack.",B.cb,B.cz)
