B.TP=new A.bY("ranged_aoe","AOE","Instead target a {Level/3} space radius.\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, make an attack.",B.e4,B.cz)
B.TE=new A.bY("ranged_poisoner","Poisoner","On Player Failure, They must make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 1 succeeds on an attack, cause the targets to make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} extra damage.",B.e4,B.cz)
B.TA=new A.bY("ranged_burn","Burn","On Player Failure, they gain {Half Level} d6 Burn.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, give the chump and all characters range 1 {Half Level} d6 burn.",B.e4,B.cz)
B.T5=new A.bY("ranged_sacrifice","Sacrifice","On Player Failure, They gain {Half Level} d6 Bleed.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, Give the chump up to {Level} d6 bleed and give an enemy the same amount.",B.e4,B.cz)
