B.ZD=new A.E("feature_thorns_Root","Root","As long as you are concentrating on thorns, At the end of the target\u2019s turn, if the target hasn't moved on their turn, the thorns grow 1 space outward up to {1 + Source}. If an enemy makes any Attack in the thorn growth, they take the damage. Whenever the target moves or dashes they lose the roots. ")
B.ZV=new A.E("feature_thorns_Burs","Burs","After an enemy takes damage from your thorns, make an Status Check vs Wis, On a Success, the target has Burs, reducing their speed by {half Source}. On the Start of the target\u2019s turn, repeat the Status Check, On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and if you Miss, the effect ends.")
