B.OU=new A.eZ("quadrupedal_herding","Herding","You may not climb. You have difficult prone. Gain +1 Speed.\nTrampling: [Reaction] During your turn, spend your reaction; you may move through an enemy who is a smaller size than you. Make a Status Check vs Str. On Success, deal {Difference in size between the target and you d6}.\nHerd: [Reaction] During a target ally's turn, spend your reaction and move up to the target's speed as long as you end within 6 spaces of the target.","{Half Level} times per story, you summon a bunch of casual friends who are all meeting up with you. You must explain the reason for the meetup at this place and time.",B.afS)
