B.OT=new A.eZ("quadrupedal_pouncing","Pouncing","[Reaction] At the start of an enemy turn, spend your reaction, dash {Half Level} to a free space range 1 of an enemy, and make an Attack vs Str. On success, grapple the target and give them {Half Level d6} Bleed.","{Half Level} times per story, when you attack from concealment with a melee blow and kill your prey, you don't break concealment.",B.aj9)
B.Ou=new A.dO("Dodges","{Half Level}",!0)
B.adR=s([B.Ou],t.F)
B.P1=new A.eZ("quadrupedal_springing","Springing","Ignore difficult terrain. You may not climb, and have difficult prone. [Reaction] Start of any turn, spend your reaction and dash {Half Level} spaces. You may target another creature; if you do, make a status check vs Str. On success, knock them prone, then dash {Half Level} spaces to a free space. Otherwise dash to a free space adjacent to the target. Allies may make a Dex defense to resist falling prone.","{Half Level} times per story, when you would be grabbed, grappled, or restrained, instead dodge out of the way.",B.adR)
B.agd=s([B.OU,B.OT,B.P1],t.CT)
B.Pc=new A.eB("Quadrupedal","Quadrupedal","Difficult Prone: To stand from prone, you must make and succeed on either a Brute or Finesse check, and it also requires the use of all your speed. If an effect would reduce the cost to stand from prone, instead it costs Half Speed to stand.","","",B.d0,B.agd)
