B.adQ=s([B.Ow],t.F)
B.P4=new A.eB("bodyplan_hexapodal","Hexapodal","","Ignore Difficult Terrain. You have +1 to grapple checks. When enemies force you to move, you move half as far. You may not be knocked prone; when you would gain prone, instead lose {Vitality} health. You may not reduce or resist this damage.\nScuttle: [Reaction] Start of any turn, spend your reaction and dash {Level} to a free space.","{Level} times per story, after succeeding a defense, you scuttle under something or out of sight of whatever caused you to defend. Then make a conceal check to hide from it.",B.adQ,B.iW)
