B.agE=s([B.Os],t.F)
B.P8=new A.eB("bodyplan_serpent","Serpent","","Ignore difficult terrain and reduce your speed by 2. It costs only 1 speed to stand from prone. Climbing and swimming do not cost extra speed. You may move through other creatures' spaces and your movement doesn't provoke attacks. Before making an attack, you may dash 1 space toward your target.","{Level} times per story, while concealed, you can whisper to a person you can see and only they can hear you.",B.agE,B.iW)
B.OC=new A.dO("Lures","{Half Level}",!0)
B.ahy=s([B.OC],t.F)
B.P5=new A.eB("bodyplan_mermaid","Mermaid","","Reduce your speed by 2. Moving through water doesn't cost extra movement. Gain {3 * Vitality} bonus Health and +1/+2 range on Attacks.","{Half Level} times per story, lure all characters that can hear you to your location. Your voice will only lure them for a short time, or till they are harmed.",B.ahy,B.iW)
B.Om=new A.dO("Flights","{Half Level}",!0)
B.aja=s([B.Om],t.F)
B.P6=new A.eB("bodyplan_winged","Flying","","You have -1 speed when not flying. You may start any situation already concentrating on natural flight.\n\nNatural Flight: [Reaction] During your Turn, spend your reaction and begin concentrating on natural flight. While concentrating, you gain 1 bonus speed, you dash instead of moving, and may fly vertically while moving. You must be in a free space on the ground to use abilities, weapon attacks, or at the end of your turn. You may concentrate on this in addition to other effects. Make only 1 concentration check for all the effects.\n\nIf you are knocked prone, your flight ends. Standing from prone still requires movement, and you may not fly until you are standing.","{Half Level} times per story, you can fly out of any scene or fly into any scene containing a party member. If anyone asks how you got there you must explain.",B.aja,B.iW)
