B.ajh=s([B.Ox],t.F)
B.Pb=new A.eB("bodyplan_bouncing","Bouncing","","Your movement is inconsistent and difficult to predict. Your movement doesn't provoke attacks and you may move through other creatures' spaces. At the end of your turn, choose a random direction and dash {1d6 /2} spaces in that direction. This counts as forced movement for colliding with terrain or being thrown into a pit.","{Level} times per story, after succeeding a Str, Dex, or Vit defense, you begin to bounce chaotically, preventing anyone from grabbing hold of you for a minute.",B.ajh,B.iW)
