B.Pa=new A.eB("bodyplan_swarm","Swarm","","Increase your size by 1. You cannot be flanked and don't benefit from flanking. You automatically succeed checks to escape grapple. Creatures may occupy your spaces and your spaces count as free spaces for abilities. You may move through enemies' spaces, and enemies may move through you.\nIf two or more swarms overlap, at the end of any creature's turn who is inside of the overlap, including the swarms, they must succeed a Str defense or take {Level d6} Bludgeoning damage.","{Level} times per story, you can squeeze through a door, window, through any seal or any gap.",B.ai8,B.aex)
