B.OY=new A.eZ("vehicle_winch","Winch","Winch: [Reaction] During an ally's turn, move up to {Level} in a line without provoking attacks. You may do this when prone, but you take {Half Vitality d6} damage.\nHook: [Reaction] During an ally's turn, make a Melee Attack vs Dex targeting one enemy range {1 + Half Level}. On success, deal {Half Level d6} damage and pull the target up to {Half Level + 1} spaces. You may target allies but they take only {1d6} damage.","{Half Level} times per story, you may pull anyone you see to you.",B.ahJ)
B.P_=new A.eZ("vehicle_forklift","Forklift","When you succeed on an attack against an adjacent enemy, you may lift the target until the start of your next turn. While lifted, the target is restrained, doesn't provoke attacks, and remains adjacent whenever you move, dash, or teleport.","",B.d0)
